Package: claw-os-systemd
Version: __VERSION__
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Claw OS <noreply@github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/xiaoyu-work/claw-os
Depends: claw-os-base (= __VERSION__), systemd, init-system-helpers (>= 1.52)
Description: Claw OS — systemd integration for non-Docker targets
 Installs systemd units for booting Claw OS on WSL, ISO, and VM
 targets. Specifically:
 .
   * cos-den-setup.service — sets up the /den OverlayFS at boot
     (enabled by default).
   * cos-browser.service — runs the cos-browser CDP server on port
     9222 (installed but not enabled; opt-in).
 .
 Docker containers do NOT need this package — they use cos-init as
 PID 1 instead.
